<title>THAILAND: SHINAWATRA PAYS 3.00 BAHT H1 DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>SHINAWATRA PAYS 3.00 BAHT H1 DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>     Dividend (baht)	3.00  vs  4.00</p>
<p>     Ex-dividend	    August 28</p>
<p>     Payment date	   September 10</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Shinawatra Computer and Communications Pcl, a telecommunications company.</p>
<p>--Bangkok newsroom (662) 642-0642</p>
